+@STYLES
+>## File    : styles_v20.photo1.txt
+>## Purpose : Collection of prompt templates for consistent photographic styles (v2.0)
+>## Author  : Martin Rizzo | <martinrizzo@gmail.com>
+>## Date    : Jun 8, 2026
+>## Repo    : https://github.com/martin-rizzo/ComfyUI-ZImagePowerNodes
